          "anchor" : "discussion",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Discussion",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Face colors are taken from polygon materials. RGB values use Euclid’s sRGB convention,",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "without gamma conversion. OFF does not declare a color space. Colors include alpha and",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "are clamped to 0 … 1. Normals, texture coordinates and texture images are not exported.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "content" : [
            {
              "inlineContent" : [
                {
                  "text" : "",
                  "type" : "text"
                },
                {
                  "code" : "CancellationError",
                  "type" : "codeVoice"
                },
                {
                  "text" : " if export is cancelled.",
                  "type" : "text"
                }
              ],
              "type" : "paragraph"
            }
          ],
